\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Query Dual Dynamics Delta. A query updates the low-rank workload state and is answered by the fixed-capacity value memory. A later write is scored against the accumulated query directions; the normalized heat modulates the ordinary residual Delta correction. The two states evolve on different event types and communicate only through the scalar heat. Setting $\beta =0$ exactly recovers Plain Delta.}}{7}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{7}{Query Dual Dynamics Delta. A query updates the low-rank workload state and is answered by the fixed-capacity value memory. A later write is scored against the accumulated query directions; the normalized heat modulates the ordinary residual Delta correction. The two states evolve on different event types and communicate only through the scalar heat. Setting $\beta =0$ exactly recovers Plain Delta}{figure.1}{}}
